OL,3,AAngelina Jolie and Brad Pitt settle    
OL,4,Alegal battle over French winery        
OL,6,FBrad Pitt and Angelina Jolie have      
OL,7,Fsettled a long-running legal battle    
OL,8,Fover her sale of a stake in their      
OL,9,FFrench vineyard, which unfolded amid a 
OL,10,Fbitter divorce.                        
OL,12,F"We have settled out of court in the   
OL,13,Fbest interests of our family and will  
OL,14,Fnot be commenting further," said the   
OL,15,FHollywood stars' representatives in a  
OL,16,Fjoint statement.                       
OL,18,FThey bought a controlling interest in  
OL,19,FChateau Miraval in 2008 and wed there  
OL,20,Fsix years later.                       
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
