OL,3,AAngelina Jolie and Brad Pitt settle    
OL,4,Alegal battle over French winery        
OL,6,FIn the lawsuit, Pitt, 62, argued that  
OL,7,FJolie, 51, acted without his permission
OL,8,Fin selling her share in the winery to a
OL,9,FRussian oligarch. She counter-sued,    
OL,10,Faccusing Pitt of drunkenly attacking   
OL,11,Fher and their children on a flight,    
OL,12,Fprompting her to file for divorce in   
OL,13,F2016.                                  
